# ------------------------------------------------------------------
# npm supply-chain hardening   [TRACKED IN ~/dotfiles — NO SECRETS HERE]
# Added 2026-08-09 after the keyv/cacheable "ChainDrop" worm campaign.
# Requires npm >= 12  (check: npm -v).
#
# WARNING 1: `npm config set` rewrites this file and strips comments.
# WARNING 2: this file is version-controlled. `npm login` writes
#            //registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=... into the user npmrc — if
#            that ever lands here it is a committed credential. Put auth in
#            ~/.npmrc.local (gitignored) or use an env var:
#                //registry.npmjs.org/:_authToken=${NPM_TOKEN}
